            "notes": "It begins! \n\nInner Peace for self-sustain and ability power items. The point is to build your Ult quick and use it ASAP for more AP to rebuild your ult again.\n\nWinning Attitude is one I like because a bit of extra HP and a bit of ult charge if you die is nice to have but you can choose whatever you want for that slot quite frankly.\n\nClick heads, stay alive, and ult early for more AP. I'll usually come out of this round with $7-8k on the low end, $11-12 on the high end, and $16-17 on the extreme end.",
