            "notes": "Time to start the TranscenDance.\n\nGetting ult is now your only focus. Once you have it use it like an ability cooldown and use it for 1-2 seconds at a time so you don't need to work too hard to get it back.\n\nMondatta's Mantra is mandatory! Do whatever you need to get it even if that means leaving a bunch of empty slots! \n\nThe goal is to get into a rhythm of Ulting for 2 seconds, coming out with 1,000-1,500 over health, and rebuild the Ult. The extra HP will enable you to be the most aggressive player on your team. That aggression is in the service of getting your ult back. Kick, flick, heal, and peel. Bully the tank and knock them all over the place. Disrupt the enemy team.",
