            "created_at": "2025-08-12T21:58:33.27822+00:00",
            "notes": "Last power is whatever you like. I like the mobility of the flying kick but anything that enhances your Enlightenment healing or combos well with your AP is a great choice as well. It's hard to go wrong and whatever you're most comfortable with is the right choice for you.\n\nI put Circle of Strife because it's an obvious choice that people would like but I personally don't use it. It encourages you to use too much ult and it puts you out of step with the Ult - Attack - Ult dance.\n\nThere are a lot of optional items to choose from. It will depend entirely on which power you choose at the end but there's an item or 2 that synergize with any of the choices. There are notes on the optional powers for items I like to pair them with. Along with a few optional items in case you need to lean into something specific.\n\nBut there you have it. I began using this build the day of the mid season patch when I was in low Elite and have now reached All-Star 4 without much issue. I hope it helps you climb.",
